Package: EmpiNull
Type: Package
Title: Empirical Null Calibration and Provider Inference
Version: 1.2.0
Date: 2026-09-23
URL: https://github.com/xgfang/Empirical_Null
BugReports: https://github.com/xgfang/Empirical_Null/issues
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yubo","Shao",role=c("aut","cre"),email="ybshao@umich.edu"),
